== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Cursed!}}.
* In the original game, {{i|Treasure Map}} revealed the location of {{r|Secret Room}}s as well. In Rebirth, this effect, along with the added effect of revealing of {{r|Super Secret Room}}s, now belongs to this item instead.
* {{dlc|r}} Under the minimap, {{i|The Mind}}'s icon will override the icon of this item.

